# Zidane, Tantalus Thief: "Whenever an opponent gains control of a permanent from you" is a permanent taken from Zidane's controller
# only (CR 603.10d). In a three-player game Bot2's Act of Treason takes Bot3's Grizzly Bears, and at the end of the turn the Bears
# goes back to Bot3: an opponent of Bot1 gains control of a permanent each time, but never from Bot1, so Bot1 creates no Treasure.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Zidane, Tantalus Thief
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Act of Treason
Mountain x16

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Zidane, Tantalus Thief.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
Bot3.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot3.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot3.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot3.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot3.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
[T5 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Zidane, Tantalus Thief.Power = 3
? Bot3.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Act of Treason.Cast(Bot3.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
[T5 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Keywords = Haste
[T6 Bot3.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot3.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield = Zidane, Tantalus Thief; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl
Bot2.Battlefield.Treasure Token = (absent)
Bot3.Battlefield.Treasure Token = (absent)
